WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.668
This is Choose your path, in the Week area.

00:00:02.668 --> 00:00:07.446
School and football show as locked frames, because the app plans around them.

00:00:07.446 --> 00:00:11.542
In the gaps, it suggests short study blocks. Grey means suggested.

00:00:11.542 --> 00:00:16.071
You can accept a block, move it, swap it for another subject, or drop it.

00:00:16.071 --> 00:00:23.207
Once you lock your plan in, the blocks turn green in your calendar and you get a nudge ten minutes before each one.

00:00:23.207 --> 00:00:26.310
Lock in before the deadline and you earn bonus XP.

00:00:26.310 --> 00:00:28.606
Miss a block and nothing bad happens.

00:00:28.606 --> 00:00:31.833
You just rebook the next free slot. You decide when.

00:00:31.833 --> 00:00:35.866
The app does the sums. Try it now: accept one block for tomorrow.

